<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Oil Search to bid for Discovery - source.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Oil Search to bid for Discovery - source.</headline>
<byline>Ian Pemberton</byline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Papua New Guinea-based oil producer and explorer Oil Search Ltd is expected to launch a A$112 million takeover bid for Discovery Petroleum Ltd early next week, trumping the latest offer by Premier Oil Plc and beginning its expansion away from Papua New Guinea.</p>
<p>Corporate sources told Reuters that takeover documents were now being prepared. Oil Search managing director Peter Botten, who is based in Port Moresby, would have a final round of talks with his advisers in Sydney on Friday ahead of announcing a bid, the sources said.</p>
</text>
